      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<p><strong>COLLEGE&nbsp;ADMISSIONS&nbsp;REQUIREMENTS&nbsp;FOR&nbsp;TRANSFER&nbsp;STUDENTS&nbsp;</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>THIS&nbsp;MAJOR&nbsp;IS&nbsp;OFFERED&nbsp;BY&nbsp;THE&nbsp;COLLEGE&nbsp;OF&nbsp;LETTERS&nbsp;AND&nbsp;SCIENCE&nbsp;(L&amp;S)</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>IMPORTANT&nbsp;information&nbsp;for&nbsp;students&nbsp;applying&nbsp;for&nbsp;admission&nbsp;to&nbsp;L&amp;S&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;fall&nbsp;2025&nbsp;application&nbsp;cycle&nbsp;and&nbsp;beyond:</strong></p><p></p><p>Completion&nbsp;of&nbsp;Essential&nbsp;Skills&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;(Reading&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Composition,&nbsp;Quantitative&nbsp;Reasoning,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Language)&nbsp;or</p><p>Cal-GETC/IGETC&nbsp;will&nbsp;no&nbsp;longer&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;requirement&nbsp;for&nbsp;admission;&nbsp;however,&nbsp;completion&nbsp;of&nbsp;either&nbsp;is<em>&nbsp;</em><strong><em>strongly&nbsp;recommended&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p>prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;enrollment&nbsp;at&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;to&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;timely&nbsp;degree&nbsp;progress.&nbsp;More&nbsp;information&nbsp;on&nbsp;new&nbsp;policies&nbsp;is&nbsp;available&nbsp;on</p><p>the&nbsp;L&amp;S&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ls.berkeley.edu/prospective-students/new-policies-transfer-student-applicants\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Transfer&nbsp;Student&nbsp;Applicants</a>&nbsp;website.&nbsp;</p><p></p><p><strong>By&nbsp;the&nbsp;end&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;spring&nbsp;term&nbsp;preceding&nbsp;fall&nbsp;enrollment&nbsp;at&nbsp;Berkeley,&nbsp;you&nbsp;must&nbsp;complete</strong>:&nbsp;</p><p></p><p>1)<a href=\"https://admission.universityofcalifornia.edu/admission-requirements/transfer-requirements/preparing-to-transfer/basic-requirements.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;The&nbsp;7-course&nbsp;pattern</a>&nbsp;(as&nbsp;found&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Transfer&nbsp;Admission&nbsp;Eligibility&nbsp;Courses&nbsp;Menu&nbsp;in&nbsp;ASSIST):</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Two&nbsp;transferable&nbsp;courses&nbsp;in&nbsp;English&nbsp;composition;</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;One&nbsp;transferable&nbsp;course&nbsp;in&nbsp;mathematical&nbsp;concepts&nbsp;and&nbsp;quantitative&nbsp;reasoning;</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Four&nbsp;transferable&nbsp;college&nbsp;courses&nbsp;chosen&nbsp;from&nbsp;at&nbsp;least&nbsp;two&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;following&nbsp;subject&nbsp;areas:</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">o&nbsp;arts&nbsp;and&nbsp;humanities</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">o&nbsp;social&nbsp;and&nbsp;behavioral&nbsp;sciences</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">o&nbsp;physical&nbsp;and&nbsp;biological&nbsp;sciences</p><p></p><p>AND</p><p></p><p>2)&nbsp;<strong>Major&nbsp;Requirements</strong>:&nbsp;</p><p>Follow&nbsp;the&nbsp;guidance&nbsp;on&nbsp;preparation&nbsp;for&nbsp;this&nbsp;major&nbsp;below.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">NOTE:&nbsp;Beginning&nbsp;in&nbsp;fall&nbsp;2027,&nbsp;all&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;students&nbsp;that&nbsp;are&nbsp;offered&nbsp;admission&nbsp;to&nbsp;L&amp;S&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;directly&nbsp;admitted&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;major&nbsp;they&nbsp;select&nbsp;on&nbsp;their&nbsp;College&nbsp;of&nbsp;Letters&nbsp;and&nbsp;Science&nbsp;(L&amp;S)&nbsp;application.</span></p><p></p><p><strong>L&amp;S&nbsp;General&nbsp;Education&nbsp;requirements:</strong></p><p></p><p>For&nbsp;information&nbsp;on&nbsp;courses&nbsp;that&nbsp;will&nbsp;satisfy&nbsp;L&amp;S&nbsp;General&nbsp;Education&nbsp;(Essential&nbsp;Skills&nbsp;and</p><p>Seven-Course&nbsp;Breadth)&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;from&nbsp;your&nbsp;community&nbsp;college&nbsp;complete&nbsp;the&nbsp;following&nbsp;steps:</p><ol><li>Go&nbsp;to&nbsp;\"Search&nbsp;below&nbsp;for&nbsp;articulation&nbsp;agreements:&nbsp;Major,&nbsp;department,&nbsp;and&nbsp;campus-specific&nbsp;general&nbsp;education&nbsp;agreements”</li><li>Click&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;down&nbsp;arrow&nbsp;to&nbsp;select:&nbsp;Academic&nbsp;Year,&nbsp;Institution:&nbsp;<strong>UC&nbsp;Berkeley</strong>,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Agreements&nbsp;with&nbsp;Other&nbsp;Institutions:&nbsp;(Your&nbsp;CA&nbsp;Community&nbsp;College).&nbsp;</li><li>Click&nbsp;on&nbsp;“View&nbsp;Agreements”.</li><li>Under&nbsp;“View&nbsp;Agreement&nbsp;by”&nbsp;select&nbsp;“<strong>General&nbsp;Education/Breadth</strong>”.&nbsp;</li><li>Click&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;“General&nbsp;Education/Breadth”&nbsp;radio&nbsp;button,&nbsp;then&nbsp;click&nbsp;on&nbsp;“View&nbsp;Agreement”</li></ol><p></p><p><strong>Learn&nbsp;more&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;<a href=\"http://admissions.berkeley.edu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Office&nbsp;of&nbsp;Undergraduate&nbsp;Admission</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;specifically&nbsp;about&nbsp;<a href=\"https://admissions.berkeley.edu/apply-to-berkeley/transfer-students/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">transfer&nbsp;admission</a>&nbsp;preparation.</strong>&nbsp;</p><p></p><p><strong>Review&nbsp;all&nbsp;available&nbsp;majors&nbsp;at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://undergraduate.catalog.berkeley.edu/programs?page=1&amp;pq=\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">UC&nbsp;Berkeley</a></strong>.</p>",
        "groupId": "15e66f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 1,
        "area": "General"
      },
      {
        "type": "GeneralTitle",
        "content": "program",
        "groupId": "b1dc6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 2,
        "area": "General"
      },
      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<p>Our&nbsp;undergraduate&nbsp;program&nbsp;aims&nbsp;to&nbsp;provide&nbsp;a&nbsp;broad&nbsp;and&nbsp;solid&nbsp;background&nbsp;in&nbsp;fundamental&nbsp;physics&nbsp;through&nbsp;introductory&nbsp;course&nbsp;work,&nbsp;and&nbsp;then&nbsp;to&nbsp;engage&nbsp;all&nbsp;our&nbsp;majors&nbsp;who&nbsp;are&nbsp;interested&nbsp;in&nbsp;current&nbsp;research&nbsp;with&nbsp;some&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;top&nbsp;research&nbsp;groups&nbsp;worldwide.&nbsp;We&nbsp;believe&nbsp;a&nbsp;Physics&nbsp;degree&nbsp;represents&nbsp;strong&nbsp;training&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;broad&nbsp;range&nbsp;of&nbsp;careers.&nbsp;Approximately&nbsp;half&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;recent&nbsp;graduates&nbsp;have&nbsp;continued&nbsp;to&nbsp;graduate&nbsp;school&nbsp;in&nbsp;Physics&nbsp;and&nbsp;related&nbsp;fields;&nbsp;others&nbsp;have&nbsp;taken&nbsp;jobs&nbsp;in&nbsp;high&nbsp;tech&nbsp;industries&nbsp;or&nbsp;as&nbsp;management&nbsp;consultants,&nbsp;and&nbsp;still&nbsp;others&nbsp;have&nbsp;entered&nbsp;medical&nbsp;school&nbsp;or&nbsp;law&nbsp;school.&nbsp;We&nbsp;aim&nbsp;to&nbsp;help&nbsp;our&nbsp;majors&nbsp;develop&nbsp;strong&nbsp;mathematical&nbsp;and&nbsp;analytical&nbsp;skills,&nbsp;good&nbsp;laboratory&nbsp;skills,&nbsp;effective&nbsp;written&nbsp;and&nbsp;oral&nbsp;communication&nbsp;skills,&nbsp;and&nbsp;of&nbsp;course&nbsp;a&nbsp;solid&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;fundamental&nbsp;laws&nbsp;that&nbsp;govern&nbsp;the&nbsp;universe.</p><p></p><p><strong>Learn&nbsp;more&nbsp;about&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;physics&nbsp;on&nbsp;our&nbsp;website:&nbsp;</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://physics.berkeley.edu/academics/undergraduate-degree/the-major-and-minor-program\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://physics.berkeley.edu/academics/undergraduate-degree/the-major-and-minor-program</a></p><p></p><p><strong>For&nbsp;more&nbsp;information:</strong></p><p>Location:&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;Department&nbsp;of&nbsp;Physics,&nbsp;Physics&nbsp;Building,&nbsp;Berkeley,&nbsp;CA&nbsp;94720-7300</p><p>Email:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:physics-student-services@lists.berkeley.edu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">physics-student-services@lists.berkeley.edu</a></p>",
        "groupId": "b3dc6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 3,
        "area": "General"
      },
      {
        "type": "GeneralTitle",
        "content": "important major information",
        "groupId": "aadc6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 4,
        "area": "General"
      },
      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<p><strong>Required&nbsp;lower-division&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;for&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;students:</strong></p><ul><li>Math&nbsp;51,&nbsp;Math&nbsp;52,&nbsp;Math&nbsp;53,&nbsp;Math&nbsp;54</li><li>Physics&nbsp;7A,&nbsp;7B,&nbsp;and&nbsp;7C</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>PHYSICS&nbsp;and&nbsp;MATHEMATICS</strong></p><p>Must&nbsp;complete&nbsp;physics&nbsp;and&nbsp;math&nbsp;courses&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;transferring.</p><p></p><ul><li>Physics&nbsp;major&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;students&nbsp;are&nbsp;expected&nbsp;to&nbsp;have&nbsp;completed&nbsp;all&nbsp;physics&nbsp;and&nbsp;mathematics&nbsp;program&nbsp;prerequisites.&nbsp;Physics&nbsp;89&nbsp;(Introduction&nbsp;to&nbsp;Mathematical&nbsp;Physics)&nbsp;at&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;is&nbsp;strongly&nbsp;recommended&nbsp;during&nbsp;the&nbsp;summer&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;first&nbsp;semester&nbsp;at&nbsp;UCB&nbsp;or&nbsp;post-admission&nbsp;during&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;semester&nbsp;at&nbsp;UCB.&nbsp;Students&nbsp;who&nbsp;have&nbsp;not&nbsp;completed&nbsp;Math&nbsp;54&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;admission&nbsp;as&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;students&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;required&nbsp;to&nbsp;complete&nbsp;Physics&nbsp;89&nbsp;instead&nbsp;of&nbsp;Math&nbsp;54&nbsp;at&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>Those&nbsp;not&nbsp;familiar&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;Python&nbsp;programming&nbsp;language&nbsp;are&nbsp;urged&nbsp;to&nbsp;take&nbsp;Physics&nbsp;77,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;8&nbsp;or&nbsp;the&nbsp;equivalent.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>If&nbsp;your&nbsp;course&nbsp;work&nbsp;has&nbsp;not&nbsp;been&nbsp;approved&nbsp;for&nbsp;articulation&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;equivalent&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;listed&nbsp;above,&nbsp;retain&nbsp;syllabi&nbsp;and&nbsp;reading&nbsp;lists&nbsp;for&nbsp;evaluation&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;department&nbsp;and&nbsp;proactively&nbsp;contact&nbsp;a&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;physics&nbsp;advisor&nbsp;upon&nbsp;enrollment&nbsp;to&nbsp;check&nbsp;how&nbsp;the&nbsp;missing&nbsp;courses&nbsp;will&nbsp;impact&nbsp;academic&nbsp;planning.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>For&nbsp;the&nbsp;Physics&nbsp;7-series&nbsp;equivalent&nbsp;courses,&nbsp;if&nbsp;the&nbsp;entire&nbsp;series&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nbsp;completed&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;community&nbsp;college,&nbsp;it&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;the&nbsp;student’s&nbsp;responsibility&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;the&nbsp;missing&nbsp;topics&nbsp;via&nbsp;Physics&nbsp;49&nbsp;once&nbsp;at&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley.&nbsp;This&nbsp;will&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;adequate&nbsp;foundation&nbsp;for&nbsp;upper&nbsp;division&nbsp;courses.&nbsp;Contact&nbsp;your&nbsp;physics&nbsp;major&nbsp;advisor&nbsp;at&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;for&nbsp;more&nbsp;information&nbsp;and&nbsp;guidance,&nbsp;once&nbsp;accepted&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;program.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>Once&nbsp;enrolled&nbsp;in&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley,&nbsp;we&nbsp;recommend&nbsp;that&nbsp;students&nbsp;enroll&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;Pre-Core&nbsp;Transfer&nbsp;Summer&nbsp;Program&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;summer&nbsp;before&nbsp;their&nbsp;first&nbsp;semester&nbsp;at&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;in&nbsp;order&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;better&nbsp;prepared&nbsp;to&nbsp;take&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;academic&nbsp;rigor&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;physics&nbsp;major&nbsp;by&nbsp;building&nbsp;technical&nbsp;skills&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;community&nbsp;of&nbsp;support&nbsp;and&nbsp;resources.</li></ul>",
        "groupId": "abdc6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
